<h2>Tracking Premiums</h2>

<p>
    As you receive quotes, you'll want to record the premium for each submission. This helps you:
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Compare quotes side-by-side</li>
    <li>See which option is most competitive</li>
    <li>Track changes if carriers revise their quotes</li>
    <li>Update the renewal with accurate premium information</li>
</ul>

<p>
    To add or update a premium, click the edit icon next to the premium field on a submission. You can enter the premium amount, and it will be displayed prominently in the submissions list.
</p>

