<h2>Organizing Submissions</h2>

<p>
    Submissions are automatically organized by wholesaler groups, making it easy to see which wholesaler is helping you access which carriers. You'll see:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Wholesaler groups</strong> – Submissions going through the same wholesaler are grouped together</li>
    <li><strong>Direct appointments</strong> – Submissions going directly to carriers (without a wholesaler) are shown separately</li>
    <li><strong>Active vs. closed</strong> – Completed or declined submissions can be collapsed to keep the view clean</li>
</ul>

<p>
    This organization helps you quickly see which wholesalers are working on which carriers and track progress across multiple quotes.
</p>

