<h2>Working with Multiple Submissions</h2>

<p>
    It's common to have several submissions for a single renewal as you shop around. Here are some tips for managing multiple submissions:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Update statuses promptly</strong> – As soon as you know a quote came in or was declined, update the status so your team knows where things stand</li>
    <li><strong>Mark the incumbent</strong> – If one of the submissions is from the current carrier, mark it so it's easy to identify</li>
    <li><strong>Add notes</strong> – Use the notes field to record important details like "Requires 10% down payment" or "Best coverage option"</li>
    <li><strong>Attach quotes</strong> – Upload the actual quote documents so they're easy to reference when creating proposals</li>
    <li><strong>Track contacts</strong> – Assign the right carrier or wholesaler contact to each submission so you know who to follow up with</li>
</ul>

