<h2>When a Submission is Bound</h2>

<p>
    When a client accepts a quote and you bind coverage, mark the submission as "Bound." This triggers several automatic updates:
</p>

<ul>
    <li>The renewal status will automatically change to "Renewed"</li>
    <li>The carrier and wholesaler information from the submission will sync back to the renewal</li>
    <li>Any related tasks (like "Renew in AMS") may be automatically completed</li>
    <li>The premium and other details will be available for creating proposals and settlements</li>
</ul>

<p>
    This automation helps keep everything in sync so you don't have to manually update multiple places.
</p>

