<h2>Managing Declined or Rejected Submissions</h2>

<p>
    Not every submission will result in a bound policy. When a carrier declines or a quote is rejected, you can mark the submission accordingly:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Declined</strong> – The carrier declined to provide a quote</li>
    <li><strong>Rejected</strong> – The quote was rejected (by you or the client)</li>
    <li><strong>Non-Renewed</strong> – A serious issue where the carrier won't renew</li>
</ul>

<p>
    These submissions can be collapsed in the view to keep your active submissions front and center, but they remain in the system for reference and reporting.
</p>

