<h2>Attachments and Notes</h2>

<p>
    Each submission can have attachments and notes attached to it:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Quote documents</strong> – Upload the actual quote PDFs or documents</li>
    <li><strong>Applications</strong> – Keep the submitted applications with the submission</li>
    <li><strong>Emails</strong> – Attach relevant email correspondence</li>
    <li><strong>Notes</strong> – Add internal notes about the submission, requirements, or follow-up needed</li>
</ul>

<p>
    Having everything in one place makes it easy to find what you need when creating proposals or answering client questions.
</p>

