<h2>Best Practices</h2>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Create submissions early</strong> – As soon as you decide to get a quote from a carrier, create the submission</li>
    <li><strong>Update statuses regularly</strong> – Keep statuses current so your team knows where things stand</li>
    <li><strong>Record premiums immediately</strong> – When you get a quote, enter the premium right away</li>
    <li><strong>Attach documents</strong> – Don't just record that you got a quote—attach the actual document</li>
    <li><strong>Use notes</strong> – Add context that will help you or your team later</li>
    <li><strong>Mark the bound submission</strong> – When coverage is bound, mark it immediately so the renewal status updates</li>
</ul>

